\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Thou hidden source of calm repose,
\par Thou all-sufficient Love divine,
\par My help and rrefuge from my foes,
\par Secure I am, if Thou art mine:
\par And lo! from sin, and grief, and shame.
\par I hid me, Jesus, in Thy name.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thy mighty name salvation is,
\par And keeps my happy soul above;
\par Comfort it brings, and power, and peace,
\par And joy, and everlasting love:
\par To me, with Thy dear name,  are given
\par Pardon, and holiness, and heaven.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Jesus, my all in all Thou art;
\par My rest in toil, my ease in pain,
\par The medicine of my broken heart,
\par In war my peace, in loss my gain,
\par My smile beneath the tyrant's frown,
\par In shame my glory and my crown:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. In want my plentiful supply,
\par In weakness my almighty power,
\par In bonds my perfect liberty,
\par My light in Satan's darkest hour,
\par In grief my joy unspeakable,
\par My life in death, my heaven in hell.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

